[en.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT]
The Crystal Sacrament

[en.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT_desc]
Flurry Heart claims to have heard the voice of the Crystal Heart. Thus, it has inscribed the “Crystal Sacrament” to convey the divine prophecy of the Crystal Heart to the world. The official government of the Crystal Empire has translated the “Sacrament” into a more accessible language for publication. Within the “Sacrament”, guidelines are set for the behavior of the Crystal Empire’s ponies. For instance, it is deemed a moral obligation for every Crystal pony to support the royal family, for those who dare to oppose shall face the retribution of the Crystal Heart. Each and every citizen of the Crystal Empire should take pride in acquiring and perusing the “Sacrament”, and diligently act in accordance with its teachings.

[en.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT_TOOLTIP]
We need at least §Y300§! seats to support us, currently we have: [?C15.C15_full_support|Y0].\nOr, we need to have more than §Y250§! seats ourselves, currently we have: [?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0].

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT]
《水晶圣章》

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT_desc]
风雪之心宣称聆听到了来自水晶之心的声音，因而写下《水晶圣章》向世界传达水晶之心的神谕。水晶帝国官方政府将《圣章》翻译为通俗的语言后发表。《圣章》对水晶帝国小马们的行为准则做出了规定。例如：拥护皇室是每名水晶小马的道德义务，违反者则会受到水晶之心的惩罚。每位水晶小马公民都应该以购买和阅读《圣章》为荣，按照《圣章》行事。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SACRAMENT_TOOLTIP]
我们需要至少 §Y300§! 席位的支持，目前的支持票：[?C15.C15_full_support|Y0]。\n或者，我们需要自身拥有超过 §Y250§! 席位，目前的席位：[?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0]。

